  ('AggregatedPnode', 'participationCategory', true, 'ParticipationCategoryMPM', NULL, 'Designated Control Area participation in LMP price measurement ''Y'' - Participates in both Local Market Power Mitigation (LMPM) and System Market Power Mitigation (SMPM) ''N'' - Not included in LMP price measures ''S'' - Participatesin SMPM price measures ''L'' - Participatesin LMPM price measures', 'schema/cim/IEC_CIM.ttl'),
