  ('DopInstruction', 'plotPriority', false, 'nonNegativeInteger', NULL, 'A value used to establish priority of the DOP when plotting. This is only applicable when two DOPs exist for the same time, but with different MW values. E.g. when indicating a step in the curve. Its used to determine if the curve steps up or down.', 'schema/cim/IEC_CIM.ttl'),
