  ('EndDeviceControl', 'reason', false, 'string', NULL, 'Reason for the control action that allows to determine how to continue processing. For example, disconnect meter command may require different processing by the receiving system if it has been issued for a network-related reason (protection) or for a payment-related reason.', 'schema/cim/IEC_CIM.ttl'),
